    "notes": "The tomato crop: it grows through 8 stages on farmland in the light, faster with bone meal, and is planted from tomato seeds (the block item, with its own id msm_starter:tomato_seeds). Fully grown it drops one tomato and tomato seeds, more with Fortune; younger it drops only what planted it (the crop loot preset). Farmer villagers sow and harvest it on farmland."
